# Rhythm Culture Community

### Learning French and Italian with Emilie Matyja

Emilie is one of our lead dancers from the dance coop and also a drumming student from our Palmwoods class. She was born in France, has lived in Italy and travelled around the world before settling on the Sunshine Coast. She's a Hawaian dancer, a yoga teacher (private sessions available on request) and a language teacher. Here are some info on what services she offers as a language teacher. Don't hesitate to contact her for further information!

